   <text>
      <body>
         <div><pb facs="#facs_1" n="1" xml:id="img_0001"/>
            <ab facs="#facs_1_r">
            </ab><fw type="header" place="top" facs="#facs_1_r_3">
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_3_tl_1" n="N001"/>The Return of <rs type="person">Sherlock Holmes</rs></fw><head facs="#facs_1_r_4">
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_4_tl_1" n="N003"/>II The Adventure of the Norwood Builder</head>
            <p facs="#facs_1_r_1">
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_1" n="N001"/>"From the proint of view of the criminal expert" said
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_3" n="N003"/>Mr. <rs type="person">Sherlock Holmes</rs> "London has become a singularly
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_6" n="N006"/>uninteresting city since the death of <rs type="person">Professor Moriarty</rs>."
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_8" n="N008"/>"I can hardly think that you would find many <add place="supralinear">decent citizens</add> to
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_10" n="N010"/>agree with you" <del type="crossedOut">said</del> I answered.
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_11" n="N011"/>"Well, well, I must not be selfish" said he, with a
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_13" n="N013"/>smile, as he pushed back his chair from the breakfast table
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_14" n="N014"/>"The community is certainly the gainer<del>."</del> <add>, and no one the loser save</add> 
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_15" n="N015"/><del type="crossedOut">"And who is the loser?</del>
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_17" n="N017"/><del type="crossedOut">"Why,</del> the poor out-of-work specialist whose
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_18" n="N018"/>occupation has gone. With that man in the field one's
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_20" n="N020"/>morning<del type="crossedOut">s</del> paper presented infinite possibilities. Often it was
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_21" n="N021"/>only the smallest trace, Watson – the faintest indication - and
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_22" n="N022"/>yet it was enough to tell me that the great malignant brain was
               <lb facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_23" n="N023"/>there, as the gentlest tremor of the edges of the web remind one of</p></div>
      </body>
